                    rdf:value "The EEG signals were recorded during participants' relaxed states to ensure artifact-free data, using the g.tec EEGcap, 16 Ag/AgCl electrodes, g.tec GAMMAbox, g.tec USBamp, and BCI2000 system ... The recorded data were filtered using a bandpass filter within the frequency range of 0.1-60 Hz and a notch filter at 60 Hz, subsequently digitized at 256 Hz." ] ;
            oa:hasTarget <https://doi.org/10.46604/aiti.2024.13951> ;
            slr:claim_label "A fully specified acquisition chain applied identically to both groups - montage, ground, reference, filters and sampling rate - which is better acquisition reporting than any behavioural instrument in this review, and which removes the acquisition asymmetry that undermines several other branches." ;
