                    rdf:value "The Device provided a determinate output (ASD positive or negative) for 31.8% (135/425) of participants... the Device yielded these ASD positive or negative results with a PPV of 80.8% (95% CI, 70.3%–88.8%), NPV of 98.3% (95% CI, 90.6%–100%), sensitivity of 98.4% (95% CI, 91.6%–100%), and specificity of 78.9% (95% CI, 67.6%–87.7%)." ] ;
