            oa:hasBody [ a dcterms:Text ;
                    rdf:value "For some items on ADOS-2, higher scores did not reflect the severity of ASD symptoms. For example, in item B-11, Quality of Social Response, a rating of 1 is ... whereas a rating of 2 is ... In this case, there was no clear difference between scores 1 and 2 regarding the severity of ASD symptoms, and the differences were considered to be limited to phenotypic differences in symptoms." ] ;
            oa:hasTarget <urn:slr:article:aa6615a55671> ;
