        [ a oa:Annotation ;
            oa:hasBody [ a dcterms:Text ;
                    rdf:value "To date, only a handful of ML studies used kinematic data for autism prediction. All studies had small sample sizes and achieved high classification accuracy. Models developed with small sample/high dimensional data are prone to fit noise and not necessarily an underlying pattern separating classes" ] ;
