            oa:hasBody [ a dcterms:Text ;
                    rdf:value "Increased task complexity did not amplify the discrimination signal (Synthesis). While the presented design was not intended to test this explicitly, a possible explanation may be that the higher-order inferential processes required to complete this task were executed covertly, without being reﬂected in the eye-tracking data." ] ;
