        [ a oa:Annotation ;
            oa:hasBody [ a dcterms:Text ;
                    rdf:value "However, a fundamental question remains unanswered: How do the predictions of the AI algorithms correspond and compare with the predictions of humans? This is a critical question if AI technology is to be used as an assistive tool, because the utility of an AI algorithm would be negligible if it provides little information beyond what clinicians can readily infer." ] ;
