                    rdf:value "The goal of the Device is not to enable diagnosis of all presentations of ASD, but to aid primary care HCPs to diagnose the subset of children the Device can confidently determine a recommendation for, potentially precluding the need to refer all children for tertiary center evaluation. Reducing tertiary referral loads by even a third could significantly shorten wait times" ] ;
