        [ a oa:Annotation ;
            oa:hasBody [ a dcterms:Text ;
                    rdf:value "Based on raw eye-tracking data, our machine learning algorithm could classify the three groups with an accuracy of 81.1% and relatively high sensitivity and specificity. Classification became worse if only data from the gaze or nongaze conditions were used, suggesting that \"less-social\" directional cues also carry useful information for distinguishing these groups." ] ;
            oa:hasTarget <urn:slr:article:0e322379d4f9> ;
