                    rdf:value "For the video neural network, we found that the ADOS items that were more strongly associated with the ASD probability were the Initiation of Joint Attention, Quality of Social Overtures, the presence of Unusual Eye Contact as well as the occurrence of Pointing Gestures ... For the audio neural network, the ADOS items that were most strongly related to the ASD probability were the occurrence of Showing Behavior (to share interest), Pointing Gesture, Unusual Sensory Exploration, and Hand Mannerisms" ] ;
