        [ a oa:Annotation ;
            oa:hasBody [ a dcterms:Text ;
                    rdf:value "Our initial evaluation of task models showed that a single component of the belief after the protocol attains values close to one. It appears as though only four tasks are needed to reach a conclusive assessment, which is by no means a valid result. The fact that the ADOS protocol ... consists of 5 modules with at least 10 tasks in each module only emphasizes the fact that four tasks should not be enough to reach a diagnosis." ] ;
