            oa:hasBody [ a dcterms:Text ;
                    rdf:value "All ASD children were recruited and received diagnostic conﬁrmation based on the Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders, Fifth Edition (DSM-V). However, we had limited access to reliable information in the school site. Thus, the children were assessed by using the parent report on the Autism Behavior Checklist (ABC), Social Communication Questionnaire (SCQ), Social Responsiveness Scale (SRS), and Clancy Behavior Scale (CABS)." ] ;
