        [ a oa:Annotation ;
            oa:hasBody [ a dcterms:Text ;
                    rdf:value "Mental health professionals should be aware of unintentional reinforcement of stigma and the pathologization of (mal)adaptive social strategies like social camouflaging. Adapting one's behavior in social contexts - whether to avoid discrimination or to achieve personal goals - is not inherently pathological and does not necessarily indicate autism." ] ;
