                    rdf:value "The initial dataset consisting of 20 TD and 20 ASD children, was split into the 8:2 ratio for use as training (16 TD, 16 ASD) and validation (4 TD, 4 ASD) sets. We then prepared two different testing sets (test #1: 20 TD and 16 ASD; test #2: 10 TD and 8 ASD) to test the trained model and check its robustness." ] ;
