            slr:relevance_score "0.85"^^xsd:float ],
        [ a oa:Annotation ;
            oa:hasBody [ a dcterms:Text ;
                    rdf:value "The full tested model classified a total of 81.4% children (n = 631,308) as low risk, and 18.6% children (n = 144,632) as high-risk. This high-risk group included 874 children with ASD, which is an incidence rate of 0.006, 4.3-fold higher than the ASD incidence in the entire cohort (0.001)." ] ;
