            slr:assessed_on "full_text" ;
            slr:decision "include" ;
            slr:decision_rationale "Full text confirms a primary computational study: two datasets - 15 autistic adults, 15 adults with schizophrenia and 16 controls; 15 autistic children and 15 controls - all diagnosed under DSM-5 research criteria with ADOS-2 re-evaluation for autism and PANSS for schizophrenia; the Facial Emotion Identification Test administered while gaze was recorded on a Tobii Pro Fusion at 120 Hz; fixation, saccade and scan-path features plus gaze heat maps; a multilayer perceptron baseline and a CNN, each aggregated across 21 or 32 per-image decisions by hard voting or by random-forest weighting; and nested leave-one-participant-out cross-validation reporting accuracy, sensitivity, specificity and binomial tests against chance. Eligible on all criteria." ;
            slr:full_text_source "user_supplied_pdf" ;
