            slr:assessed_on "full_text" ;
            slr:decision "include" ;
            slr:decision_rationale "Full text confirms a primary computational study: 436 toddlers aged 17-36 months recruited at four paediatric primary care clinics, screened with M-CHAT-R/F and evaluated with ADOS-T where indicated; six social and non-social movies presented on an iPad with the front camera recording; face detection, identity-based tracking to isolate the child, 49-landmark extraction, affine normalisation to a canonical face with head-pose estimation, and low-pass filtering; a modified multiscale entropy analysis handling missing data and normalised for across-subject comparison; group comparisons with Mann-Whitney U, Wilcoxon signed-rank and ANCOVA adjusting for missing-data percentage and landmark variation; and a decision-tree classifier with leave-one-out cross-validation reporting accuracy, precision, recall and ROC/AUC with DeLong comparisons, plus logistic-regression odds ratios. Eligible on all criteria." ;
