            slr:decision_rationale "Full text confirms supervised classification of autism using eye-tracking features extracted from gaze during dynamic social video - a behavioural modality - fused with EEG features via stacked denoising autoencoders, evaluated by subject-independent stratified ten-fold cross-validation with accuracy, sensitivity, specificity, ROC/AUC and confusion matrices reported for four model variants. The eye-tracking modality alone is also evaluated and reported (86.67% accuracy), so the study contributes a behavioural-input result as well as a fused one." ;
