            slr:decision_rationale "Full text confirms a primary study within the Geneva Autism Cohort: 80 autistic and 80 typically developing children aged 1.1 to 5.1 years, matched for age, sex and ADOS module, recorded during ADOS assessments between September 2012 and September 2023. A video network operating on OpenPose skeletal renderings over a black background and an audio network operating on the full audio band were trained independently and combined, with a 50-50 participant-level train-test split. Ethics approval, written parental consent, funding and competing interests are all declared, code is published on GitHub and a de-identified pose-estimation subsample on Zenodo. Eligible on every criterion." ;
