            slr:decision "include" ;
            slr:decision_rationale "Full text confirms a computational study on the Kaggle autistic-children facial image corpus (2,940 images), comparing five ImageNet-pretrained convolutional networks as frozen feature extractors - MobileNet, Xception, VGG16, VGG19 and EfficientNet - with logistic regression as the binary classifier, across three preprocessing configurations and with augmentation applied. This is the eighth study in the review built on this corpus family. Included, with the record made explicit that the corpus's autistic class is harvested from autism-associated online sources so that class membership is confounded with image provenance." ;
