                    slr:supporting_quote "A corpus mixing a public web-scraped collection with images from an Indonesian autism centre, with the proportion from each source and their distribution across classes unreported, the number of distinct children unstated, and no demographic information for either class." ],
                [ a slr:RoBDomainJudgment ;
