                    slr:supporting_quote "The outcome is the Class/ASD traits field, the Q-CHAT-10 screening result. No clinician, diagnostic instrument, criterion or assessor exists for any record - though the paper is accurate in calling this a trait prediction rather than a diagnosis." ],
                [ a slr:RoBDomainJudgment ;
