                    slr:supporting_quote "Five-fold nested cross-validation with participant-independent splits and per-fold class balancing; each child's multiple story/modality/phase samples are kept within a single fold; bootstrap 95% confidence intervals on every estimate; a per-fold majority-class baseline included as a lower bound." ],
                [ a slr:RoBDomainJudgment ;
                    slr:domain_name "Reference standard" ;
