                    slr:supporting_quote "CNN-GRU with a correctly argued rationale for temporal modelling, ROI cropping appropriate to uncontrolled video, and identical hyperparameters across all five compared architectures - but no learning rate, batch size, epoch count or seed is reported." ],
                [ a slr:RoBDomainJudgment ;
