                    slr:supporting_quote "Diagnoses were made by a licensed, experienced clinical team following DSM-5, independently of this study, and the authors explicitly note the provisionality of early-age diagnoses and the limitations of the instruments available to them." ],
                [ a slr:RoBDomainJudgment ;
