                    slr:supporting_quote "Age-matched groups with comparable anthropometrics, a targeted exclusion list removing competing causes of balance impairment, and an a priori power analysis - but recruitment route is not described, sex is unmatched, and inclusion criteria requiring comprehension and task performance restrict the ASD sample to more able children." ],
