                    slr:supporting_quote "All five exclusions are attributed to camera technical problems with group counts given, and per-group tracking failure rates are reported - but the fifteenfold difference in failure rate between groups (3.46% versus 0.23%) is not analysed." ],
                [ a slr:RoBDomainJudgment ;
