                    slr:judgment "unclear" ;
                    slr:supporting_quote "Eligibility criteria are explicit including IQ threshold and exclusion of ADHD and schizophrenia, and the comparison group is screened for first-degree relative diagnoses; but group-wise demographics did not survive extraction and the companion study on the same cohort reports a significant 15-point IQ difference, here handled as a covariate rather than by matching." ],
                [ a slr:RoBDomainJudgment ;
