                    slr:supporting_quote "Age and sex are stated to be non-significantly different between groups but no group-wise figures or test statistics are reported, and group-wise IQ is not given despite IQ being the one clinical variable the features predict; the mixed-diagnosis comparison group is a design strength." ],
                [ a slr:RoBDomainJudgment ;
