                    slr:judgment "high" ;
                    slr:supporting_quote "Age and sex are matched and formally tested, but best-estimate IQ differs by 45 points (104 versus 58.8, p < 0.001) with the autistic group's mean in the intellectual disability range, and no covariate adjustment or matched subsample is attempted despite IQ being measured for every child." ],
                [ a slr:RoBDomainJudgment ;
                    slr:domain_name "Flow and timing" ;
