                    slr:supporting_quote "The 12 EEG features were selected by t-tests across all 80 children before leave-one-out cross-validation, and the gaze cluster count K was chosen from classification results, so held-out labels informed both feature selection and preprocessing; the headline figure is also the best of three classifiers." ] ;
            slr:overall_judgment "high" ;
